---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | ChinaStyle Traditional Wear Guide"
  description="Terms of use for ChinaStyle. Content attribution, quoting policy, editorial standards, and disclaimer for our Chinese traditional clothing travel guide."
  canonicalUrl="/terms/"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "Terms", url: "/terms/" }]}>
  <section class="pt-24 pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#b5343a] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="font-serif-sc text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-stone-900 mt-3">
        Terms of Use
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-stone-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Last updated: August 3, 2026. These terms govern your use of ChinaStyle (www.chinese-traditional-wear.com), an independent cultural travel guide to Chinese traditional clothing experiences.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Editorial Independence</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            All content on ChinaStyle is researched and written by our editorial team, led by Li Wei (MA in Chinese Art History). We do not accept payment for reviews or rankings. Historical and cultural facts are fact-checked against official sources including the Palace Museum (故宫博物院) and the China National Silk Museum (中国丝绸博物馆).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Content Attribution & Quoting</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            You may quote or excerpt our content with attribution. Please credit "Li Wei, ChinaStyle" and link back to the original page. Bulk reproduction or republishing of full pages requires written permission — contact us via the <a href="/contact/" class="text-vermillion-600 underline">contact page</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Pricing & Information Accuracy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Prices, opening hours, visa rules, and travel conditions change frequently and without notice. We verify details at the time of publication (see "Last verified" dates on each guide) but recommend confirming with official sources before booking. ChinaStyle is not liable for losses arising from outdated information.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Third-Party Bookings</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            ChinaStyle does not sell tours, rentals, or tailoring services. Any booking you make with Hanfu rental shops, tailors, museums, or travel providers is a transaction between you and that provider, governed by their own terms.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Original text and site design are © ChinaStyle. Photography is used under license from Pexels and Unsplash or belongs to their respective owners. Trademarks and institution names referenced for identification belong to their respective holders.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We may update these terms as the site evolves. Continued use of ChinaStyle after changes are published constitutes acceptance. Questions? Reach us via the <a href="/contact/" class="text-vermillion-600 underline">contact page</a> or see our <a href="/privacy/" class="text-vermillion-600 underline">privacy policy</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
